{"version":1,"content":"<p>很想體驗冬日獨有的白色浪漫，不一定要飛赴歐美日韓，位於吉林省的長白山一樣能滿足你！</p><p>除了降雪量大、雪質媲美阿爾卑斯山之外，還可一睹全球最高的火山湖，試玩舉世聞名的霧淞漂流，在宛如仙界的河道中靜候第一線晨曦！</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T07:21:27.149083+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T07:00:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T07:14:40.548234+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T07:14:40.548234+00:00","content_hash":"4a2945d87fdf058691b89e2ad24cc9626058428f78e91b1e7eb3e920158d26df","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}